"datasecurityparagraph": "We take appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data against loss, misuse, unauthorized access, and unwanted disclosure. Your data is stored and transmitted encrypted.",
 
"retentionperiod": "Retention Period",
"retentionperiodparagraph": "We do not keep your personal data longer than necessary for the purposes for which it was collected. Usage data is retained for a maximum of 2 years, unless you request deletion earlier.",
 
